5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's make sure we have a real handle on the numbers this time so we aren't just guessing!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I've noticed a certain hesitation in the air lately. I wonder if the current cost is weighing on people.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It's not just the cost. Some people do all the work while others just show up once in a while.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should also consider the administrative burden. The treasurer's role seems quite taxing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I just hope we don't make it too formal. We want newcomers to feel welcome and able to drift in.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, that's true. I'll check the ledger and the bank statements to see what we actually have.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the turnout since summer and the feedback from the winter social.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm going to check the sign-in sheets and the rota to see who's actually doing the heavy lifting.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I'll examine the treasurer's logged hours and the records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the taster evening forms and the old minute books to see how we handled things before.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
