30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Most of our costs are fixed, like hall hire, but getting people to pay the renewals on time is a struggle.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,It seems that adding charges to outings actually pushed people away from the weekday meetings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Takumi,,It's exactly as I thought. A tiny group of people are doing almost all the attending and the work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Chasing small payments is a nightmare for the treasurer, and mid-year calculations are a huge time sink.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"People are scared of committing to a full year upfront, and old tiered systems caused a lot of friction.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, so if we charge per event, we might lose even more people on the slow nights?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,Exactly. And some members already feel uneasy about the cost per visit because they attend so rarely.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, if we keep a flat fee, the people who do everything are basically subsidizing the ghosts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, but a complex system to fix that would just make the treasurer's life even more miserable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, but we can't just ignore the people who can't pay a lump sum at the start.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,It sounds like we're stuck between making it easy for the treasurer and fair for the members.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"We need to remove the ""weighing up"" process. People should just feel they belong.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I still think we need to acknowledge the imbalance in attendance. It's becoming a talking point.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Whatever we choose, it must minimize the manual calculations and the constant chasing of money.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"And it shouldn't create ""grades"" of members. That just makes the quieter ones feel like outsiders.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
