55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is simple, but the bank statements show some people really struggle with a single lump sum.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C seems risky. The summer data shows that per-event charges kill the casual atmosphere.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option B could address the fairness issue, but Kenji mentioned that tiers caused friction in the past.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is the only one that doesn't destroy the treasurer's free time. Option C is a disaster.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm worried Option B will make people feel like second-class members. Option A is too steep for some.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if we go with A, can we allow people to spread the payments to avoid the renewal struggle?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I'm leaning toward A. It makes the weekday meetings ""theirs"" again without a price tag.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, but does that solve the problem of the same nine people doing all the work?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the fee structure isn't a rota. We can handle the work separately, but the money must be simple.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"If we do Option C, it's easier for newcomers to join, but I agree it might feel too transactional.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I want a stable budget. Option A gives us a clear figure we can count on.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for A. Let's bring back the feeling of belonging without the hesitation.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm torn, but if B causes social friction, I'll go with A for the sake of peace.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I strongly vote for A. I won't support any system that requires six hours of chasing a month.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll vote for A too, as long as we are flexible with how people pay that annual fee.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'm voting for A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
